	(text "Fit R10 (always on) OR R11 (Pico GPIO control), never both.\nJT33 pins: 1 GND, 2 GND, 3 OUT, 4 VDD. Clipped sine >=0.8 Vpp, AC-coupled by C10.\nFirmware: RegTcxo (0x4B) bit 4 TcxoInputOn = 1.  XTB (pin 6) left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35dbfea1-8357-4835-9174-2214025615fd")
	)
	(text "Feed 3V3 from J2 (bench) OR J1-1 (Pico 3V3), never both.\nPull JP1 shunt and insert ammeter: expect ~87 mA at +17 dBm."
