	(text "Ra-01H: 803-930 MHz, ~+20 dBm max, ~100 mA TX. Same 17x16 mm SMD-16 pinout as Ra-01\n(check pad pitch against the Ra-01H drawing before layout).\nShares SCK/MOSI/MISO with U1; own chip select (LORA_NSS), reset and DIO0/DIO1.\nC23 / R17 / C24: pi-match footprint for antenna tuning; fit 0R only to start.\nANT pad -> J5: short 50 ohm trace (coplanar w/ ground), keep away from the 144 MHz chain.\nNever transmit on both radios at once."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 104.14 0)
